Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {"", Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{
       TemplateBox[{
         Cell[
          TextData["WickLogarithmicNegativity"]], 
         "paclet:QuantumMobQ3/ref/WickLogarithmicNegativity", 
         "QuantumMobQ3 Package Symbol"},
        "PackageLink",
        BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["grn", "TI"], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["1", "TR"]], ",", 
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["2", "TR"]], ",", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], 
      "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "946f247b-bffc-49eb-91f5-5bf5e99459de"],
     "\[LineSeparator]returns the logarithmic entanglement negativity between \
the subsystem consisting of fermion modes {k1, k2,\[Ellipsis]}\[Subset]{1,2,\
\[Ellipsis],n} in the fermionic Gaussian state characterized by n\[Times]n \
matrix grn of single-particle Green's function. "
    }],ExpressionUUID->"8de6b3b2-8a3f-4662-a5e6-e11b079cf2da"]},
   {"", Cell[TextData[{
     "WickLogarithmicNegativity[ws,",
     Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"{", "k1"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "5f5969d1-fcc2-4d47-9de6-5de9d1e0763a"],
     ",k2,\[Ellipsis]}]\[LineSeparator]calculates the logarithmic negativity \
for the Wick state (fermionic Gaussian pure state without pairing \
correlation) ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["ws", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "d316d729-6567-4443-934c-129914e1bc00"],
     ". "
    }],ExpressionUUID->"29714f6d-9b2f-483f-aaab-c3bf4e8f4dad"]},
   {"", Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{
       TemplateBox[{
         Cell[
          TextData["WickLogarithmicNegativity"]], 
         "paclet:QuantumMobQ3/ref/WickLogarithmicNegativity", 
         "QuantumMobQ3 Package Symbol"},
        "PackageLink",
        BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["data", "TI"], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["1", "TR"]], ",", 
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["2", "TR"]], ",", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], 
      "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "2797ea1b-980d-49da-8a5a-f18e11ea69b4"],
     "\[LineSeparator]calculates the logarithmic negativities of elements of ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["data", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "dbcf5efe-9239-4dd3-9adf-913e497a3a9e"],
     ", which may be an array of Green's function matices or Wick states."
